OpenCode Permission Reviewer

The reviewer policy design is inspired by OpenAI Codex Guardian:

  https://github.com/openai/codex/tree/main/codex-rs/core/src/guardian

The policy wording and implementation are independent. The plugin adds
OpenCode permission semantics, human escalation, confidence validation,
isolated review, and SSH, local-script, and Git evidence enrichment.

